  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252femissive-glowing-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/emissive-glowing-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>螢光發亮礦石</strong> 為主世界與地獄的礦石新增發光材質。必須安裝 OptiFine、Continuity 或任何支援發光材質的模組，否則不會產生任何變更。</p>\n<p>以下方塊將具備發光效果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>鐵礦石</li>\n<li>煤礦石</li>\n<li>紅石礦石</li>\n<li>綠寶石礦石</li>\n<li>鑽石礦石</li>\n<li>青金石礦石</li>\n<li>金礦石</li>\n<li>銅礦石</li>\n<li>古老殘骸</li>\n<li>鍍金黑石</li>\n<li>地獄石英礦石</li>\n<li>地獄金礦石</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8f57345b-7d7e-4495-85d1-769ec501a0e8.webp\" alt=\"洞穴中的發光礦石\"></p>",
